  "created": "2026-10-12T21:06:25.78Z",
  "description": "The stanzasharp command: downloads Stanza's English models for StanzaSharp, checked against their MD5s, e.g. in a Dockerfile or CI. \"stanzasharp download DIR [--package default_fast] [--processors tokenize,mwt,pos]\". \"stanzasharp compare FILE\" runs Python Stanza and StanzaSharp on your own text and shows whether their output is identical; \"stanzasharp benchmark\" measures both on your machine. Needs no native libtorch.",
  "id": "StanzaSharp.Tool",
